# dotenv environment variable files
.env*

# ...except the two that carry NO secrets and MUST be committed:
#  - .env.template documents every variable the app reads.
#  - .env.development supplies the LOCAL endpoint defaults; `src/config/env.ts` declares them with no
#    fallback, so this file is what keeps local work zero-config while a device/EAS build still has to be
#    told its endpoints explicitly.
!.env.template
!.env.development

